        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Polished Brass Lever Trim for 88 Series Exit Device, Von Duprin 373L</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Entry Function Lever (key locks and unlocks lever) for Von Duprin  <a href=\"/products/polished-brass-88-series-rim-exit-device-with-lever-trim-von-duprin-88l3\">88 Series Rim Exit Device</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for Von Duprin Series 373L Keyed Entry Lever\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Function: Entry - Key locks and unlocks the lever. When unlocked turning the lever unlatches the exit device. </li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate 7/8\" Thick Forged Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Polished Brass</b> </li>\r\n<li>Handed</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 keys</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>",
